DESCRIPTION:Baraat · Jaimala · Reception. The baraat arrives at 7 with
  the band; come early if you are dancing in it. Jaimala at 8\, and the
  reception runs from 8 onwards with dinner served across eighteen coun
 ters till 11:30. The pheras follow later in the night; sit with us for
  them\, it is the heart of the evening. Dress: Traditional. Reds\, gol
 ds\, ivories. Silks\, bandhgalas\, sherwanis\, saris\, lehengas.
END:VEVENT
